# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_176783> (vitamin C)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_176783> "Any member of a group of vitamers that belong to the chemical structural class called butenolides that exhibit biological activity against vitamin C deficiency in animals. The vitamers include <small>L</small>-ascorbic acid and its salt, ionized and oxidized forms.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_176783> "vitamin C")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_176783> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_50523>)
