AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_28201> "A member of the class of rotenones that consists of 1,2,12,12a-tetrahydrochromeno[3,4-<em>b</em>]furo[2,3-<em>h</em>]chromen-6(6a<em>H</em>)-one substituted at position 2 by a prop-1-en-2-yl group and at positions 8 and 9 by methoxy groups (the 2<i>R</i>,6a<i>S</i>,12a<i>S</i>-isomer). A non-systemic insecticide, it is the principal insecticidal constituent of derris (the dried rhizome and root of <em>Derris elliptica</em>).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_28201> "rotenone")
