# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35481> (non-narcotic analgesic)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35481> "A drug that has principally analgesic, antipyretic and anti-inflammatory actions. Non-narcotic analgesics do not bind to opioid receptors.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35481> "non-narcotic analgesic")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35481> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35480>)

