# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35493> (antipyretic)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35493> "A drug that prevents or reduces fever by lowering the body temperature from a raised state. An antipyretic will not affect the normal body temperature if one does not have fever. Antipyretics cause the hypothalamus to override an interleukin-induced increase in temperature. The body will then work to lower the temperature and the result is a reduction in fever.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35493> "antipyretic")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35493> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23888>)

