AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_38565> "A (6<i>E</i>)-7-[3-(4-fluorophenyl)-1-(propan-2-yl)-1<em>H</em>-indol-2-yl]-3,5-dihydroxyhept-6-enoic acid diastereoisomer in which the stereocentres β- and δ- to the carboxy group have <i>R</i> and <i>S</i> configuration, respectively. The drug fluvastatin is an equimolar mixture of this compound and its enantiomer.")
